    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an artistic journey through time and space! From the heights of Montmartre in Paris to the golden wheat fields of Arles, from the tropical paradise of Tahiti to the majestic Mount Sainte-Victoire in Provence, the Magical Cat will guide you through an enchanted world of art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Travel Through Artistic Time</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the brilliant golden hues of sunflowers and the swirling nebulae of starry nights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the vibrant colors of Tahitian paradise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the geometric landscapes of Provence's rolling hills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find artistic inspiration among blooming almond blossoms and cypress trees</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Unique Artistic Experience<br>Inspired by the Post-Impressionist masters, we reinterpret their iconic artistic language:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Van Gogh's emotional brushstrokes and swirling skies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gauguin's pure tropical colors and primitive essence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C\u00e9zanne's geometric spatial structure and color composition</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Innovative Perspective<br>This is not just an ordinary puzzle journey, but a feast of art and imagination. Each artwork is carefully crafted, infusing classical artistic language with a modern perspective to create a unique visual experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab Artistic Discovery<br>Following the Magical Cat's footsteps, you'll discover in puzzles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The banks of the Rh\u00f4ne under the southern French sun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twinkling night caf\u00e9s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primitive life in tropical paradise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geometrically rendered natural landscapes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Game Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtfully designed puzzle difficulty progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 exciting puzzle artworks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle wallpaper unlocked after completion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm and healing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and enjoyable puzzle-solving experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Perfect For</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle enthusiasts: Enjoy puzzle-solving with unique visual styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art explorers: Experience modern interpretations of classic art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual gamers: Relax in an artistic atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Magical Cat and immerse yourself in an ocean of art, where every puzzle piece becomes a gateway to discovering beauty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252520/extras/6e1375f9f73284ab5c5c22c05d4371b3.avif?t=1741347400\" width=512 height=640 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252520/extras/bf75eb5b3581eda4c6d21a46bbd9f95c.avif?t=1741347400\" width=512 height=744 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252520/extras/9a2655b0e136671592cbd4f8798c2f89.avif?t=1741347400\" width=512 height=624 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252520/extras/60d5296cb0fb35a90e688e9955e04315.avif?t=1741347400\" width=512 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf1 Gameplay Guide | Detailed Tutorial | Beginner's Tips</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Essential Controls:<br>\u2728 Left-click to place puzzle pieces<br>\u2728 Right-click and drag to move the view<br>\u2728 Mouse wheel to zoom in/out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 Special Features:<br>\u2728 Hint system available for every puzzle<br>\u2728 Complete puzzles to unlock HD wallpapers (auto-saves to desktop)<br>\u2728 Progress auto-saves for each puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Extra Tips:<br>\u2728 Change background colors<br>\u2728 Reset camera view<br>\u2728 Shuffle pieces anytime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tips: Take your time and enjoy the journey! Each puzzle is uniquely crafted for your entertainment! \ud83c\udfa8\u2728</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an artistic journey through time and space! From the heights of Montmartre in Paris to the golden wheat fields of Arles, from the tropical paradise of Tahiti to the majestic Mount Sainte-Victoire in Provence, the Magical Cat will guide you through an enchanted world of art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Travel Through Artistic Time</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the brilliant golden hues of sunflowers and the swirling nebulae of starry nights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the vibrant colors of Tahitian paradise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the geometric landscapes of Provence's rolling hills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find artistic inspiration among blooming almond blossoms and cypress trees</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Unique Artistic Experience<br>Inspired by the Post-Impressionist masters, we reinterpret their iconic artistic language:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Van Gogh's emotional brushstrokes and swirling skies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gauguin's pure tropical colors and primitive essence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C\u00e9zanne's geometric spatial structure and color composition</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Innovative Perspective<br>This is not just an ordinary puzzle journey, but a feast of art and imagination. Each artwork is carefully crafted, infusing classical artistic language with a modern perspective to create a unique visual experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab Artistic Discovery<br>Following the Magical Cat's footsteps, you'll discover in puzzles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The banks of the Rh\u00f4ne under the southern French sun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twinkling night caf\u00e9s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primitive life in tropical paradise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geometrically rendered natural landscapes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Game Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtfully designed puzzle difficulty progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 exciting puzzle artworks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle wallpaper unlocked after completion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm and healing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing and enjoyable puzzle-solving experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Perfect For</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle enthusiasts: Enjoy puzzle-solving with unique visual styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art explorers: Experience modern interpretations of classic art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual gamers: Relax in an artistic atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Magical Cat and immerse yourself in an ocean of art, where every puzzle piece becomes a gateway to discovering beauty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252520/extras/6e1375f9f73284ab5c5c22c05d4371b3.avif?t=1741347400\" width=512 height=640 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252520/extras/bf75eb5b3581eda4c6d21a46bbd9f95c.avif?t=1741347400\" width=512 height=744 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252520/extras/9a2655b0e136671592cbd4f8798c2f89.avif?t=1741347400\" width=512 height=624 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252520/extras/60d5296cb0fb35a9